Every clinician should not treat an acute-pain with an ER-LA-opioid.
Every clinician should not initiate an ER-LA-opioid for a subacute-pain.
Every clinician should not initiate an ER-LA-opioid for a chronic-pain.
Every clinician should not prescribe an ER-LA-opioid for an intermittent-or-as-needed-use.
